    "discipline": "Industrial",
    "subject": "Engineering Management",
    "chapter": "Performance Measurement",
    "topic": "KPIs",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "<p>A <b>key performance indicator</b> (or KPI) is a metric that is one of the most important indicators of the current performance level of an individual, department and/or company in achieving goals.</p>\r\n<p>KPI must be a quantifiable measure.</p>",
