    "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n    <div class=\"col-8\">\r\n\r\n<h5><span><b>Areas:</b></span></h5>\r\n<br/>\r\nSquare: $a^2$<br/>\r\nRectangle: $ab$<br/>\r\nTriangle: $\\dfrac{1}{2}$ base $\\times$ height<br/>\r\nCircle: $\\pi r^2$ = $\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}D^2$<br/>\r\nEllipse: $\\pi \\times ab$<br/>\r\n<br/>\r\n\r\n<h5><span><b>Volumes:</b></span></h5>\r\n\r\n<br/>\r\nCube: $a^3$<br/>\r\nBox: lbh<br/>\r\nSphere: $\\dfrac{4}{3} \\pi r^3$<br/>\r\nCone: $\\dfrac{1}{3} \\pi r^2 h$\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col\">\n<center>\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/Soviet_jars.jpg\" alt=\"Volume of Containers\" width=\"340\"><br/>\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Soviet_jars.jpg\">Maximaximax</a>, CC BY-SA 3.0</small></small></center>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
