    "content_html": "<ul>\r\n<li>An algorithm is a well-defined procedure that allows a computer to solve a problem. </li>\r\n<li>An algorithm is a sequence of unambiguous instructions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nAlgorithm types we will consider include: \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Simple recursive algorithms </li>\r\n<li>Backtracking algorithms </li>\r\n<li>Divide and conquer algorithms </li>\r\n<li>Dynamic programming algorithms </li>\r\n<li>Greedy algorithms </li>\r\n<li>Branch and bound algorithms </li>\r\n<li>Brute force algorithms </li>\r\n<li>Randomized algorithms</li>\r\n</ul>",
