    "chapter": "Probability Distributions",
    "topic": "Permutations and Combinations",
    "subtopic": "Overview",
    "content_html": "In Permutations, order matters.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span class=\"math display\">\\[P(n,r) = \\dfrac{n!}{n-r!}\\]</span> In Combinations, order does not matter.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span class=\"math display\">\\[C(n,r) = \\dfrac{n!}{r!(n-r)!}\\]</span></p>",
    "important": "\\[P(n,r) = \\dfrac{n!}{n-r!}\\]\r\n\r\n\\[C(n,r) = \\dfrac{n!}{r!(n-r)!}\\]",
    "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><!-- <div class=\"w-full mt-2\"><div style=\"padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/831809864?h=ab78b31006&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"Permutations and Combinations\"></iframe></div><script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script></div> --></div>",
